{"3248990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Detectorist Guild", "steam_appid": 3248990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248990/extras/4d2913319f373eefb839c701aa250967.avif?t=1788274882\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248990/extras_big/4d2913319f373eefb839c701aa250967.webp?t=1788274882 width=1560 height=625 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Shiverly, a peaceful English village in Yorkshire, at the turn of the millennium, where rolling fields, friendly locals and buried secrets await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248990/extras/065505dfb441a815afa9af100cff8781.avif?t=1788274882\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248990/extras_big/065505dfb441a815afa9af100cff8781.avif?t=1788274882 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Detectorist Guild, you join James who is free to roam the town and surrounding countryside locations with his trusty metal detector, searching for artefacts that reveal the stories of the past. Villagers often misplace their prized belongings and it is up to James to track them down, return what is lost and earn their trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248990/extras/0e31774effbaaa9282b61c17032f6169.avif?t=1788274882\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248990/extras_big/0e31774effbaaa9282b61c17032f6169.avif?t=1788274882 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beneath the cosy surface lies something more. As James digs deeper into the village’s history, a dark mystery begins to emerge, drawing him and his family into a tale that connects past and present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248990/extras/f82f6feafc01a776247e9f347faeb204.avif?t=1788274882\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248990/extras_big/f82f6feafc01a776247e9f347faeb204.webp?t=1788274882 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Donate historical discoveries to the local museum and learn their origins. Sell 20th Century antiques to the local Emporium and use the money to upgrade equipment to reach new depths and uncover more valuable treasures. Every field, footpath and forgotten corner could hide your next great discovery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248990/extras/dc9f5f79f2dbe0b43e59599a6108a4cb.avif?t=1788274882\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248990/extras_big/dc9f5f79f2dbe0b43e59599a6108a4cb.avif?t=1788274882 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax, explore and collect at your own pace in a low-pressure RPG experience that celebrates curiosity, history and the quiet thrill of the find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248990/extras/02686acf13ff9dee833e2ccc461ac078.poster.avif?t=1788274882\" width=1170 height=696 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248990/extras/02686acf13ff9dee833e2ccc461ac078.webm?t=1788274882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248990/extras/02686acf13ff9dee833e2ccc461ac078.mp4?t=1788274882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Use an accurately simulated detector with frequency, ground balance and sensitivity controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248990/extras/01c4aa9d23b576fb8537cfe856c3a572.poster.avif?t=1788274882\" width=1170 height=696 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248990/extras/01c4aa9d23b576fb8537cfe856c3a572.webm?t=1788274882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248990/extras/01c4aa9d23b576fb8537cfe856c3a572.mp4?t=1788274882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore a historical countryside village with a distinct 1990s British atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248990/extras/fc7d17aafa90da541b06122e15ef081f.poster.avif?t=1788274882\" width=1170 height=696 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248990/extras/fc7d17aafa90da541b06122e15ef081f.webm?t=1788274882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248990/extras/fc7d1